#: inc/getting-started.php:80
msgid "2. Set your colors and logo"
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:81
msgid "Open Styles in the Site Editor and choose Default, Editorial or Midnight. Add your logo in the header. Text, surfaces and cards follow the palette; check contrast after changing colors."
