#: inc/getting-started.php:82
msgid "3. Connect a contact method"
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:83
msgid "Replace sample phone numbers with a real tel: link, or insert your form plugin block. Link every contact button to the actual contact section or page. A contact pattern does not send messages."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:84
msgid "4. Prepare the handover"
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:85
msgid "Give the update owner permission to edit the homepage. Page content mode lets an Editor update its text without access to site-wide templates. CMS menu settings do not change permissions or lock the layout."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:86
msgid "5. Check before publishing"
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:88
msgid "Replace every sample name, phone number, price, opening hour and testimonial with verified information."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:89
msgid "Check every button, phone link, form submission and notification email."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:90
msgid "Check mobile navigation, long titles, empty search results and keyboard focus."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:91
msgid "Preview as the update owner and confirm they can find and save the right page."
msgstr ""

#: inc/getting-started.php:93
msgid "Optional: ROBSE ONE Blocks adds a CTA and client menu guide. ROBSE ONE AI creates text outlines and editable drafts; it does not choose images, build a complete website or connect a form."
